<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 95,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 95,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's est receipts 95,000, Wk ago 126,000, and Yr ago 80,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher than mid-session Friday. Trade was slow for goood demand and light offerings. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
